@orderId = {{'0a07eb09-399a-48cb-bfda-9e7be7d8f7f2'}}

### Create order (uses current user's cart — locked + re-validated in one transaction)
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "couponCode": "SAVE10",
  "loyaltyPointsAmount": 100
}

### List orders
GET http://localhost:3000/orders

### Get order by id
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/{{orderId}}

### Change order status
PATCH http://localhost:3000/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

### Delete order (PENDING only)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/orders/{{orderId}}
